This font uses an old filet/cross-stitch chart from the book "Priscilla Filet Crochet Book" published in 1911 by Robinson, Belle, ed.



Scans of this book are found at
https://www.antiquepatternlibrary.org/html/warm/6-JA035-50.htm
where they are shared under the Creative Commons Licence CC-BY-NC-SA 4.0

